#35100
Credits Room - Ice Caverns~
This is a Rom conversion by Breeze originally converted by corwin.  Lvl range
is 25-50 group Its a series of icy caves and plateaus and the forces conjured
within are what has caused the freezing of the southern plains below Mahntor.
Linked to Icy Plains/Obsidian at 11382
~
