You have entered into a prison of sorts, only this kind of prison needs
no lock.    All around you, creatures are frozen in various stages of
torture and tossed aside.    A shiver runs down your spine as you see a
large parchment pinned to a wall.    A closer look at the parchment shows it
to list "Upcoming Meals."  
~
