#35189
The Temple of Brys~
All around you, intricate ice sculptures have been formed.  They all look
so realistic, as if someone froze people in various stages of worship.    As
you peer around the room a bitterly cold wind sweeps through and chills you
to the bone.    An eerie silence blankets the temple, not even the footsteps
of the priestesses make a sound.    You look down and realize that not just
ice, but snow as well, covers the floor.  
~
