#35190
At the Altar~
A large altar dominates this area of the temple.  Laying upon the altar
you see many implements of sacrifice..  All covered in blood and all made of
ice.  This is the temple of the Winter Goddess -- Brys.    You feel her eyes
freezing you with their evil caress as she watches you defile her altar.   
A bucket of semi-frozen blood rests at the foot of the altar, reminding you
of the fountain you passed earlier.  
~
